OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgent review needed' amid
OL,4,Amonth-long delivery delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have complained as
OL,7,Fletter deliveries in one town are
OL,8,Ftaking up to four weeks to arrive.
OL,10,FPeople in Bridgwater, Somerset, have
OL,11,Fbeen missing key appointments or
OL,12,Fwaiting weeks for bank cards to arrive,
OL,13,Fwith the town's MP calling for Ofcom to
OL,14,Furgently review whether Royal Mail's
OL,15,F"chronically understaffed" team is a
OL,16,Fbreach of its licence.
OL,18,FResident Jayne Mogg organised a public
OL,19,Fmeeting about the issue on Saturday and
OL,20,Fsaid people are very frustrated.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
