OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgent review needed' amid
OL,4,Amonth-long delivery delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Royal Mail spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"Bridgwater Delivery Office is
OL,8,Fcurrently experiencing resourcing
OL,9,Fpressures and we are taking action to
OL,10,Faddress these."
